              <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:Class" xmi:id="2b494ace-5fdf-47dd-b495-9110b54368bf" name="AtomicStampedReference">
                <ownedComment xmi:id="35202d5e-01ce-4070-bfc0-38572a84cc6a" body="An &lt;tt>AtomicStampedReference&lt;/tt> maintains an object reference&#xA;along with an integer &quot;stamp&quot;, that can be updated atomically.&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p> Implementation note. This implementation maintains stamped&#xA;references by creating internal objects representing &quot;boxed&quot;&#xA;[reference, integer] pairs.&#xA;&#xA;@since 1.5&#xA;@author Doug Lea&#xA;@param &lt;V> The type of object referred to by this reference&#xA;" annotatedElement="2b494ace-5fdf-47dd-b495-9110b54368bf"/>
