              <ownedComment xmi:id="3a5fe69e-b35a-45f8-bef6-e6d29058aafc" body="This runtime exception is thrown to indicate that the index of a row to be added to a &lt;i>tabular data&lt;/i> instance&#xA;is already used to refer to another row in this &lt;i>tabular data&lt;/i> instance.&#xA;&#xA;@version     3.17  03/12/19&#xA;@author      Sun Microsystems, Inc.&#xA;&#xA;@since 1.5&#xA;@since.unbundled JMX 1.1&#xA;" annotatedElement="ea565b78-f4cb-41a3-aa0c-be8f204bd799"/>
