                <ownedComment xmi:id="4d80c5cc-3473-4e4d-9d91-a6948e052cfc" body="This class implements accessibility support for the&#xA;&lt;code>JTree&lt;/code> child.  It provides an implementation of the&#xA;Java Accessibility API appropriate to tree nodes.&#xA;" annotatedElement="6ee3b3d7-5040-4b67-b0f7-d5f9a857e4f2"/>
