                  <ownedComment xmi:id="1133b93d-976e-4058-871e-907aff301afb" body="Pass the name String to the super constructor. This is used&#xA;later to identify the Action and decide whether to play it or&#xA;not. Store the resource String. I is used to get the audio&#xA;resource. In this case, the resource is an audio file.&#xA;&#xA;@since 1.4&#xA;" annotatedElement="9d4c5cb2-d69b-469f-b3f0-0caa7f2a7b8e"/>
