                  <ownedComment xmi:id="a2ed4b1a-3146-451e-a78e-95ea978400a0" body="As of Java 2 platform 1.4, this previously undocumented class&#xA;is now obsolete. KeyBindings are now managed by the popup menu.&#xA;" annotatedElement="13aec1e1-d6cb-44e6-88f4-2c24a8760588"/>
