                  <ownedComment xmi:id="a789ad16-4d68-419f-8afa-a11ded69c342" body="As of 1.4, this class is now obsolete, doesn't do anything, and&#xA;is only included for backwards API compatibility. Do not call or&#xA;override.&#xA;&lt;p>&#xA;The functionality has been migrated into &lt;code>ItemHandler&lt;/code>.&#xA;&#xA;@see #createItemListener&#xA;" annotatedElement="704f127c-5e6d-468e-883c-fa587d56324d"/>
